Hi Ravi,

They're different. Logo churn on that sheet counts only customers who had signed an annual contract; the one churned logo in the 2025 cohort is Sierra Fasteners (contract ended 2026-02-28, $48,000 ARR). The two Q1 pilots (paid pilots, $6,000 each, 90 days) never converted and are excluded from both the numerator and the denominator, which is why they only appear in the notes.

I've added a "Pilots (non-converting)" line under the table so it's visible without the notes. Let me know if you'd like them shown any other way.

